{"synopsis":"Dari Studio yang sama Dengan Damn Reincarnation\nSuatu Hari Ia Mendapati Dirinya Terjebak di dalam Neraka\nNamun Dia memiliki Tekad yang kuat Dan Kekuatan yang Kuat pula\nSetelah 9999 tahun Berlalu Ia telah Menyerap Jutaan Demon Dalam Dirinya dan Menjadi Penguasa neraka\nMengalahkan Para Monarch yang ada Di nereka\nKenapa Anda ingin Kembali Yang mulia bukankah anda sudah punya Segalanya di sini\nUcap Salah satu Monarch\nApa yang aku punya di sini Tidak ada yang bisa dimakan tidak ada yang bisa dinikmati Sudah Kuputuskan\nAku akan Kembali Ke bumi","alternative_title":"만 년 만에 귀환한 플레이어","author":"Butterfly Valley","artist":"Copin","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"dd752ee4-b6e8-486c-8706-f33a5e89f9c4","number":"154","chapter":"154","title":"Chapter 154","date":"2026-05-03","released":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"da02f80e-43a9-4284-8f3b-f9b1b072c156","number":"153","chapter":"153","title":"Chapter 153","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"bf23cc40-e1a7-4bac-96f2-29b53f36b1b9","number":"152","chapter":"152","title":"Chapter 152","date":"2026-04-12","released":"2026-04-12","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0790fc19-bcdf-4796-b9b2-613842e3e4ed","number":"151","chapter":"151","title":"Chapter 151","date":"2026-04-05","released":"2026-04-05","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"9ea0e9d0-0024-43d4-bdf2-fc8d87faad47","number":"150","chapter":"150","title":"Chapter 150","date":"2026-03-29","released":"2026-03-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"8afa914d-cd2d-4e85-855a-4940b0a5beb2","number":"149","chapter":"149","title":"Chapter 149","date":"2026-03-15","released":"2026-03-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0ab459e5-ad05-4cb8-8e59-835eea71944d","number":"148","chapter":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2026-03-08","released":"2026-03-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"585b029c-2c26-4fc2-93ca-7e321e29f484","number":"147","chapter":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2026-03-01","released":"2026-03-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"707e3006-b2c0-4412-b